# Prettier Docs Formatting
RULE: When editing `.md`, `.json`, `.yaml`, `.yml`, `.ts`, `.tsx`, `.js`, `.jsx`, or `.css`, format with Prettier before committing.
WHY: Pre-commit runs Prettier; unformatted files cause commit to fail and require a second quickmerge run.
CODEX: codex/08-workflows/ci-cd-flow.md (Prettier troubleshooting)
DO: Run `bash scripts/hooks/prettier-autostage.sh <file>` after editing docs (NEVER bare `npx prettier` — unpinned <3.9.5 mangles `_`→`*`); format on save if editor supports it
NEVER: Commit unformatted markdown/JSON/YAML — pre-commit will modify and abort; quickmerge retries once but formatting proactively avoids retries
